{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CREATE QUERY statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309166","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-QUERY-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-QUERY-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CREATE QUERY statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__section_N10036_N10033_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Creates a dynamic query.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__syntax_GC15AC2683859\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d344330e106\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__idGDG22Z2664705\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CREATE QUERY <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type HANDLE that represents the handle of the\nquery object.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name </var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression of type CHARACTER that evaluates, at run time,\nto the name of the widget pool that contains the dynamic query.<div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__note_N100B3_N100AF_N100A2_N1008B_N10041_N10033_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Widget pool names are not case-sensitive.</div></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__example_GC15AD2683869\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d344330e171\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nfollowing example creates a dynamic query with a static buffer and\na dynamic predicate (WHERE clause) which is resolved at run time:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-crtqry.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__idGDG2302664713\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>/* r-crtqry.p */\n\nDEFINE VARIABLE hQuery  AS HANDLE  NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE iNumVar AS INTEGER NO-UNDO INITIAL 10.\n\nCREATE QUERY hQuery.\n\nhQuery:SET-BUFFERS(BUFFER Customer:HANDLE). \nhQuery:QUERY-PREPARE(&quot;FOR EACH Customer WHERE Customer.CustNum &lt; &quot; +\n  STRING(iNumVar)).\nhQuery:QUERY-OPEN.\n\nREPEAT WITH FRAME y:\n  hQuery:GET-NEXT().\n  IF hQuery:QUERY-OFF-END THEN LEAVE.\n  DISPLAY \n    Customer.CustNum\n    Customer.Name FORMAT &quot;x(30)&quot;\n    Customer.City FORMAT &quot;X(20)&quot;.\nEND.\n\nhQuery:QUERY-CLOSE().\nDELETE OBJECT hQuery.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__notes_GC15AE2683873\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d344330e206\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">CREATE-QUERY\nmust be followed by the QUERY-PREPARE( ) and QUERY-OPEN()\nmethods before the query can be run.</li>\n      </ul>\n    \n     \n  \n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-QUERY-statement__see-also_GC15AF2683879\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d344330e218\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-BUFFER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-BUFFER-statement.html\">CREATE BUFFER statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-QUERY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-QUERY-statement.html\">DEFINE QUERY statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"QUERY-OPEN-method.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/QUERY-OPEN-method.html\">QUERY-OPEN( ) method</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"QUERY-PREPARE-method.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/QUERY-PREPARE-method.html\">QUERY-PREPARE( ) method</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-DATA-SOURCE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-DATA-SOURCE-statement.html\">CREATE DATA-SOURCE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SAX-ATTRIBUTES-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SAX-ATTRIBUTES-statement.html\">CREATE SAX-ATTRIBUTES statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309166","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CREATE QUERY statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-QUERY-statement.html","type":"Manual"}